    "created_at": "2022-06-22T19:06:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-22T19:06:36Z",
    "body": "Please correct me if I'm wrong but this seems especially crucial with [planned browser changes to block third-party cookies](https://blog.chromium.org/2020/01/building-more-private-web-path-towards.html). Many apps which are embedded in third-party contexts will likely deal with the third-party cookie changes by switching to [HTTP headers](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Authentication) for authentication. As a result, those apps will lose the ability to preload critical `fetch` resources which require authentication.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
