    "updated_at": "2022-07-21T17:10:43Z",
    "body": "I can't \"thumbsup\" the archived repo, so I'd like to reiterate this [comment](https://github.com/w3c/preload/issues/157#issuecomment-989452009) about using the `type` attribute to set Accept. It would certainly work for my use-case, though I can see how this would be a potentially breaking change.",
