    "created_at": "2022-07-22T11:22:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-07-22T11:22:18Z",
    "body": "In general for preloads, the `as` attribute would mean the browser uses the `Accept` header typically used for the related destination. That won't help you create an `Accept: application/json` request header though.",
